---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaAdvancedCompleteQueryRequestSuggestionTypesItemEnum "SUGGESTION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"QUERY"|"PEOPLE"|"CONTENT"|"RECENT_SEARCH"|"GOOGLE_WORKSPACE"

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaAdvancedCompleteQueryRequestSuggestionTypesItemEnumList (gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaAdvancedCompleteQueryRequestSuggestionTypesItemEnum|string)[]

