---@field textGroundingMetadata? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaAssistantGroundedContentTextGroundingMetadata Metadata for grounding based on text sources.
---@field content? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaAssistantContent The content.
---@field citationMetadata? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaCitationMetadata Source attribution of the generated content. See also https://cloud.google.com/vertex-ai/generative-ai/docs/learn/overview#citation_check

