---The metadata of a Document.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaBatchGetDocumentsMetadataResponseDocumentMetadata
---@field state? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaBatchGetDocumentsMetadataResponseDocumentMetadataStateEnum The state of the document.
