---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaControlPromoteAction
---@field dataStore? string Required. Data store with which this promotion is attached to.
---@field searchLinkPromotion? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaSearchLinkPromotion Required. Promotion attached to this action.

---Redirects a shopper to the provided URI.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaControlRedirectAction
---@field redirectUri? string Required. The URI to which the shopper will be redirected. Required. URI must have length equal or less than 2000 characters. Otherwise an INVALID ARGUMENT error is thrown.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaControlSolutionTypeEnum "SOLUTION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"SOLUTION_TYPE_RECOMMENDATION"|"SOLUTION_TYPE_SEARCH"|"SOLUTION_TYPE_CHAT"|"SOLUTION_TYPE_GENERATIVE_CHAT"|"SOLUTION_TYPE_AI_MODE"

---Creates a set of terms that will act as synonyms of one another. Example: "happy" will also be considered as "glad", "glad" will also be considered as "happy".
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaControlSynonymsAction
---@field synonyms? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.StringList Defines a set of synonyms. Can specify up to 100 synonyms. Must specify at least 2 synonyms. Otherwise an INVALID ARGUMENT error is thrown.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaControlUseCasesItemEnum "SEARCH_USE_CASE_UNSPECIFIED"|"SEARCH_USE_CASE_SEARCH"|"SEARCH_USE_CASE_BROWSE"

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaControlUseCasesItemEnumList (gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaControlUseCasesItemEnum|string)[]

