---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaCreateTargetSiteRequestList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaCreateTargetSiteRequest[]

---A custom attribute that is not explicitly modeled in a resource, e.g. UserEvent.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaCustomAttribute
---@field text? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.StringList The textual values of this custom attribute. For example, `["yellow", "green"]` when the key is "color". Empty string is not allowed. Otherwise, an `INVALID_ARGUMENT` error is returned. Exactly one of CustomAttribute.text or CustomAttribute.numbers should be set. Otherwise, an `INVALID_ARGUMENT` error is returned.
---@field numbers? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.DoubleList The numerical values of this custom attribute. For example, `[2.3, 15.4]` when the key is "lengths_cm". Exactly one of CustomAttribute.text or CustomAttribute.numbers should be set. Otherwise, an `INVALID_ARGUMENT` error is returned.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaCustomAttributeMap { [string]: gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaCustomAttribute }

