---@field alloyDbConfig? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreFederatedSearchConfigAlloyDbConfig AlloyDB config. If set, this DataStore is connected to AlloyDB.
