---@field returnedFields? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.StringList Optional. Fields to be returned in the search results. If empty, all fields will be returned.
---@field alloydbAiNlConfig? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreFederatedSearchConfigAlloyDbConfigAlloyDbAiNaturalLanguageConfig Optional. Configuration for Magic.
---@field alloydbConnectionConfig? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreFederatedSearchConfigAlloyDbConfigAlloyDbConnectionConfig Required. Configuration for connecting to AlloyDB.

---Configuration for AlloyDB AI Natural Language.
