---Configuration for connecting to AlloyDB.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreFederatedSearchConfigAlloyDbConfigAlloyDbConnectionConfig
---@field database? string Required. The AlloyDB database to connect to.
---@field instance? string Required. The AlloyDB instance to connect to.
---@field password? string Required. Database password. If auth_mode = END_USER_ACCOUNT, it can be unset. In that case, the password will be inferred on the AlloyDB side, based on the authenticated user.
---@field user? string Required. Database user. If auth_mode = END_USER_ACCOUNT, it can be unset. In that case, the user will be inferred on the AlloyDB side, based on the authenticated user.
---@field enablePsvs? boolean Optional. If true, enable PSVS for AlloyDB.
---@field authMode? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreFederatedSearchConfigAlloyDbConfigAlloyDbConnectionConfigAuthModeEnum|string Optional. Auth mode.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreFederatedSearchConfigAlloyDbConfigAlloyDbConnectionConfigAuthModeEnum "AUTH_MODE_UNSPECIFIED"|"AUTH_MODE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT"|"AUTH_MODE_END_USER_ACCOUNT"

---Config for connecting to NotebookLM Enterprise.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreFederatedSearchConfigNotebooklmConfig
---@field searchConfig? string Required. Search config name. Format: projects/*/locations/global/notebookLmSearchConfigs/*
---@field notebooks? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.StringList Optional. Restricts this data store to the given notebooks. When empty, the data store covers every notebook the querying user can access, which is the existing behaviour. Each entry is a full notebook resource name, such as `projects/*/locations/*/notebooks/*`. Scoping is enforced on results as well as requested upstream, so a notebook outside this list cannot appear in a search response through this data store even if the backend returns one.

---Stores information for third party applicationOAuth.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreFederatedSearchConfigThirdPartyOauthConfig
---@field instanceName? string Optional. The instance name identifying the 3P app, e.g., "-my". This is different from the instance_uri which is the full URL of the 3P app e.g., "https://-my.sharepoint.com".
---@field appName? string Optional. The type of the application. E.g., "jira", "box", etc.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreIndustryVerticalEnum "INDUSTRY_VERTICAL_UNSPECIFIED"|"GENERIC"|"MEDIA"|"HEALTHCARE_FHIR"

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStore[]

---Stores information regarding the serving configurations at DataStore level.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaDataStoreServingConfigDataStore
