---Restricts which users may use a feature that is turned on in `features`.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicy
---@field allowedMembers? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyMemberList Optional. Members who may use the feature.
---@field deniedMembers? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyMemberList Optional. Members who may not use the feature. Takes precedence over `allowed_members`.
---@field defaultAccess? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyDefaultAccessEnum|string Optional. Access for users who match neither list.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyDefaultAccessEnum "DEFAULT_ACCESS_UNSPECIFIED"|"ALLOW"|"DENY"

