---A user or group the policy refers to.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyMember
---@field id? string Required. Identifier evaluated at serving time. Its format depends on the project's identity provider: * Google identity (`GSUITE`): the group or user email. For groups, the server resolves the email to a group ID on write and returns the email on read. * Workforce Identity Federation (`THIRD_PARTY`), groups: the value the provider emits in `google.groups`. With SCIM this is the SCIM group ID; without SCIM and with the default Microsoft Entra mapping it is the Entra group object ID. * Workforce Identity Federation, users: the user's workforce identity subject.
---@field type? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyMemberTypeEnum|string Required. Kind of member.
---@field displayName? string Optional. Label shown in the console. Never used for evaluation.
---@field verification? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyMemberVerificationEnum|string Output only. Result of the server's directory check when the member was saved.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyMemberList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyMember[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyMemberTypeEnum "TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"USER"|"GROUP"

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturePolicyMemberVerificationEnum "VERIFICATION_UNSPECIFIED"|"VERIFIED"|"NOT_FOUND"|"NOT_VERIFIABLE"|"CHECK_FAILED"

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturesValueEnum "FEATURE_STATE_UNSPECIFIED"|"FEATURE_STATE_ON"|"FEATURE_STATE_OFF"

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturesValueEnumMap { [string]: gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineFeaturesValueEnum|string }

