---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineSearchEngineConfigSearchTierEnum "SEARCH_TIER_UNSPECIFIED"|"SEARCH_TIER_STANDARD"|"SEARCH_TIER_ENTERPRISE"

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEngineSolutionTypeEnum "SOLUTION_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"|"SOLUTION_TYPE_RECOMMENDATION"|"SOLUTION_TYPE_SEARCH"|"SOLUTION_TYPE_CHAT"|"SOLUTION_TYPE_GENERATIVE_CHAT"|"SOLUTION_TYPE_AI_MODE"

---An evaluation is a single execution (or run) of an evaluation process. It encapsulates the state of the evaluation and the resulting data.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEvaluation
---@field endTime? string Output only. Timestamp the Evaluation was completed at.
---@field createTime? string Output only. Timestamp the Evaluation was created at.
---@field state? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEvaluationStateEnum Output only. The state of the evaluation.
---@field name? string Identifier. The full resource name of the Evaluation, in the format of `projects/{project}/locations/{location}/evaluations/{evaluation}`. This field must be a UTF-8 encoded string with a length limit of 1024 characters.
---@field evaluationSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEvaluationEvaluationSpec Required. The specification of the evaluation.
---@field errorSamples? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleRpcStatusList Output only. A sample of errors encountered while processing the request.
---@field error? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleRpcStatus Output only. The error that occurred during evaluation. Only populated when the evaluation's state is FAILED.
---@field qualityMetrics? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaQualityMetrics Output only. The metrics produced by the evaluation, averaged across all SampleQuerys in the SampleQuerySet. Only populated when the evaluation's state is SUCCEEDED.

