---@field searchRequest? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaSearchRequest Required. The search request that is used to perform the evaluation. Only the following fields within SearchRequest are supported; if any other fields are provided, an UNSUPPORTED error will be returned: * SearchRequest.serving_config * SearchRequest.branch * SearchRequest.canonical_filter * SearchRequest.query_expansion_spec * SearchRequest.spell_correction_spec * SearchRequest.content_search_spec * SearchRequest.user_pseudo_id
---@field querySetSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaEvaluationEvaluationSpecQuerySetSpec Optional. The specification of the query set.

