---Record message for RankService.Rank method.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaRankingRecord
---@field score? number The score of this record based on the given query and selected model. The score will be rounded to 4 decimal places. If the score is close to 0, it will be rounded to 0.00001 to avoid returning unset.
---@field title? string The title of the record. Empty by default. At least one of title or content should be set otherwise an INVALID_ARGUMENT error is thrown.
---@field content? string The content of the record. Empty by default. At least one of title or content should be set otherwise an INVALID_ARGUMENT error is thrown.
---@field id? string The unique ID to represent the record.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaRankingRecordList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaRankingRecord[]

---Response message for Recommend method.
