---@field metadata? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.DocumentMap Additional Document metadata or annotations. Possible values: * `score`: Recommendation score in double value. Is set if `returnScore` is set to true in RecommendRequest.params.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaRecommendResponseRecommendationResultList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaRecommendResponseRecommendationResult[]

