---@field content? string Chunk textual content.
---@field blobAttachmentIndexes? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.StringList Output only. Stores indexes of blobattachments linked to this chunk.

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaSearchResponseSummaryReferenceChunkContentList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaSearchResponseSummaryReferenceChunkContent[]

---@alias gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaSearchResponseSummaryReferenceList gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaSearchResponseSummaryReference[]

---Safety Attribute categories and their associated confidence scores.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaSearchResponseSummarySafetyAttributes
---@field categories? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.StringList The display names of Safety Attribute categories associated with the generated content. Order matches the Scores.
---@field scores? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.DoubleList The confidence scores of the each category, higher value means higher confidence. Order matches the Categories.

