---Specification of tools that are used to serve the request.
---@class gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaStreamAssistRequestToolsSpec
---@field vertexAiSearchSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaStreamAssistRequestToolsSpecVertexAiSearchSpec Optional. Specification of the Vertex AI Search tool.
---@field webGroundingSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaStreamAssistRequestToolsSpecWebGroundingSpec Optional. Specification of the web grounding tool. If field is present, enables grounding with web search. Works only if Assistant.web_grounding_type is WEB_GROUNDING_TYPE_GOOGLE_SEARCH or WEB_GROUNDING_TYPE_ENTERPRISE_WEB_SEARCH.
