---@field generationSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaStreamAssistRequestGenerationSpec Optional. Specification of the generation configuration for the request.
---@field agentsSpec? gcp.unstable.discoveryengine_v1beta.GoogleCloudDiscoveryengineV1betaStreamAssistRequestAgentsSpec Optional. Specification of agents that are used to serve the request.
